# yolo-demo

YOLO object detection demo using Ultralytics.

## Installation

```bash
pip install -e .
```

## Usage

```bash
# Detect objects in an image
yolo-demo path/to/image.jpg

# Use a different model
yolo-demo path/to/image.jpg --model yolov8s.pt

# Adjust confidence threshold
yolo-demo path/to/image.jpg --conf 0.5
```
